OL,3,GNEWSASwim challenge 'error' leaves man
OL,4,Abarely able to walk
OL,5,
OL,6,FMike described the swim as "scary", but
OL,7,Fhe was happy to have raised #4,500 for
OL,8,Fthe Wiltshire Bobby Van Trust (WBVT)
OL,9,Fwhich supports older and vulnerable
OL,10,Fpeople.
